Title: MiniGrok

Summary: Cute AI assistant plugin for Nintendo 3DS

Description: |
  MiniGrok – the cute AI assistant for your 3DS.
  Chat, screen reading, file tools and title helpers,
  all with permission prompts.

  Place your xAI API key in:
  sd:/luma/plugins/MiniGrok/api.txt

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
